1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Welcome to Northwind Lab.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,400
Today we're testing Focus Mode.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,600
It hides alerts for 25 minutes.

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,800
Your current task stays on screen.

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,000
Open the Delta Board to begin.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,200
Choose one small goal.

7
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:22,400
Then press Start Session.

8
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:25,600
The timer begins immediately.

9
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:28,800
You can pause it at any time.

10
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:32,000
Paused time is not counted.

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,200
A soft sound marks the halfway point.

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:38,400
Nothing else changes on your desktop.

13
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,600
When the session ends, alerts return.

14
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:44,800
Your progress is saved locally.

15
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:48,000
No account is required.

16
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,200
We completed 3 sessions this morning.

17
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,400
The shortest one lasted 8 minutes.

18
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:57,600
That was enough to finish the outline.

19
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:00,800
Try Focus Mode with your next task.

20
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:04,000
Thanks for watching.
